#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Estimate token usage and cost across AI coding agents.

Cursor is subscription-based and stores tokens but not USD. This tool still
reports Cursor token usage and estimates what those tokens would cost under
public API pricing (the Claude Code / Anthropic / OpenAI billing model).

Claude Code reports real costs when available (costUSD in the logs), otherwise
costs are calculated from tokens × API rates.

Usage examples:
    ai-costs                              Daily report (all available sources)
    ai-costs daily --source cursor        Cursor only (estimated API cost)
    ai-costs monthly                      Monthly rollup
    ai-costs session                      Per-session breakdown
    ai-costs daily -w ~/Projects/foo      Filter by workspace
    ai-costs daily --since 2026-07-01     Date range
    ai-costs daily --json                 Machine-readable output
    ai-costs daily --offline              Don't fetch live pricing
"""

